'''Killer Cat''' (殺意のネコ Satsui no Neko, '''Killer Cat''') is a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 5.8 Update|Version 5.8]].

