==Enemy==
Killer Cat is a strong and fast pushing [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark enemy]], somewhat similar to [[Gory Dark]] in behaviour, but with few knockbacks. Even though it has single target, it can become a serious threat when at higher magnifications and in extreme quantities.

==Strategy==
Thanks to their Single Target attacks and short range, it is not too difficult to get many of them clumped up by using lots of meatshields; this often results in them being easy targets for [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] and [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]], who are both able to easily neutralize the threat posed by groups of Killer Cats regardless of their durability. In general, any meatshields + midrangers approach works fine too, though that depends by the circumstances.

